You extract corrupted blood from your own body, hitting everything in a frontal cone of radius [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5)] for [115, 154, 185, 211, 234 (TL1-5; SP 100)] blight damage.

Each creature hit has a [35%, 47%, 55%, 60%, 64% (TL1-5)] chance of being infected by a random disease, doing [134, 180, 216, 246, 273 (TL1-5; SP 100)] blight damage and weakening either Constitution, Strength or Dexterity for 6 turns.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
